 r←Test_StdForm_001(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;n;globalParms;MyGuiParms
⍝ Bring up a form with two fields in the Statusbar.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←∆Failed

 CreateGlobalParms
 globalParms←⎕NS MyGuiParms
 globalParms.centerIn←⎕NEW'Form'(('Coord' 'Pixel')('Posn'(200 300))('Size'(400 600)))
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.StdForm.CreateParms
 parms.hasStatusbar←1
 :If ⍬ ⍬≡parms.size
     parms.size←200 400
 :EndIf
 parms.minSize←100 200
 n←#._APLGUI.GUI.StdForm.Create globalParms parms
 n.VersionNo.Text←1⊃#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiAdmin.Version
 ⎕DL 1
 →FailsIf 200 400≢n.∆Form.Size
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Close'
 ⎕NQ globalParms.centerIn'Close'

 r←∆OK
